B.avY=new A.fI("I forgot my password.","On the sign-in screen tap Forgot password? to get a reset link by email. If you are signed in, go to Settings \u2192 Password \u2192 Forgot your current password?")
B.avX=new A.fI("How do I change my password?","Settings \u2192 Password. Enter your current password, then the new one twice.")
B.aw_=new A.fI("How do I change my photo or name?","Your photo and profile details are managed by your institution. Ask via the form below to have them corrected.")
B.avT=new A.fI("How do I switch to dark mode?","Settings \u2192 Appearance, then choose Light, Dark or System.")
B.avS=new A.fI("Where are my notifications?","Tap Alerts. Mark all as read clears the list.")
